      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am very sensitive to sudden noises and entering a dropped portal with a bunch of people with VRC+ was.... intense for me to say the least. With no way to disable the noise or the spam of objects popping up in my face. I had to get off after experiencing it constantly in a row like that.\n\nI would like an option to fully disable both the noise and the warp effect fully if possible.... Makes me not want to risk even joining private events since a majority of people will have it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
